    {
      "text": "使用 Gradio、LLaMA 和 OLLAMA 建立文字冒險遊戲",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "自 GPT-2 以來，開發者一直使用大型語言模型（LLM）來開發文字遊戲，但設定起來很困難。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有了 Gradio、LLaMA 3 和 OLLAMA，在你自己的電腦上免費本地運行文字遊戲變得超級簡單。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在冒險開始之前，你可以了解更多關於 Gradio、LLaMA 和 ollama 的背景：↵使用 Ollama 運行您自己的 ChatGPT 和 Copilot",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "就像上面的部落格文章一樣，將使用 ollama API，建議使用 llama3:instruct 模型。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "假設你已經拉取了模型：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "遊戲介面不太直觀，但在這篇部落格文章中應該很容易解釋：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "除了使用 Gradio 設定遊戲介面外，當按下「New Game」按鈕時，關於遊戲背景和規則的指令會發送給 LLM。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "一個非常好的遊戲指令範例可以在 https://github.com/fladdict/llm_games 找到。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "將 <to be inserted> 替換為提示詞：",
