      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "「智慧之樹，古老的存在，我們尋求你的指引。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們正在尋求擊敗魔王並為我們的世界帶來和平。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你能向我們揭示古老的神器和法術藏在哪裡嗎？」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "樹木似乎在攪動，它們的樹葉輕輕沙沙作響，彷彿它們在互相交流。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然後，它們齊聲低語：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "「尋找古老橡樹的神諭，在森林的深處。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在那裡，過去的秘密等待著你。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "但要小心，因為道路險惡，魔王的爪牙潛伏在陰影中。」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**故事進度：** 6↵**危機上升：** 1（樹木的警告表明前方有危險。）↵**技術創新：** 對與自然進行魔法交流的基本理解",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你從低語之林獲得了寶貴的資訊！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，你現在知道旅程將充滿危險。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你接下來想做什麼？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你想前往古老橡樹的神諭，還是探索森林的其他部分尋找線索和資源？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "或者你想尋求 Akira 的指導，了解如何繼續？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "請回應你的想法，我會繼續冒險！↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵Akira，請帶我們去森林的深處。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b -->↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵**森林小徑：** +↵Akira 點點頭，臉上帶著堅定的表情。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "她沿著一條蜿蜒的小徑帶領你，熟練地穿過茂密的植被。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這裡的樹木長得更高更密，在森林地面上投下斑駁的陰影。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當你行走時，空氣中瀰漫著一股超凡脫俗的能量。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你能感受到古老魔法的力量從土地本身散發出來。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Akira 停下來，眼睛盯著前方的某個東西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "她低聲說：「神諭的樹林就在附近。」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**古老橡樹林：** +↵你穿過一簾藤蔓，進入一片被高聳的樹木環繞的空地。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "中心矗立著一棵巨大的橡樹，它的樹皮因年代久遠而扭曲。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "空氣中瀰漫著古老智慧的氣息。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Akira 走近樹木，雙手伸出，彷彿在表示敬意。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "她開始輕聲吟唱，你周圍的空氣似乎隨著能量振動。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "突然，一個全息影像在你面前具體化：一個飄渺的虛幻身影，眼睛像星星一樣燃燒。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**神諭的幻象：** +↵神諭用一個在你腦海中迴響的聲音說話：「在水晶洞穴的深處尋找光之基石。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "但要小心，因為道路充滿了險惡的幻象和古老的守護者。」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "幻象消失了，留給你的問題比答案還多。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你接下來想做什麼？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你要：↵A) 出發尋找水晶洞穴↵B) 詢問 Akira 關於光之基石及其意義↵C) 探索周圍的森林尋找線索和資源",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "請回應你的選擇。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵</div><!-- box -->",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "遊戲開始崩潰。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它不再回應故事進度，而是回應多項選擇，與之前的回應不同。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這是因為聊天歷史已經達到 8k 個 token，這是模型一次可以處理的最大 token 數量。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們如何解決這個問題？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們可以使用支援更多上下文的不同模型嗎？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "還是我們應該總結故事進度，然後將其傳遞給模型？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這是你真正的冒險了！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 創建文字冒險遊戲",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">↵",
